@host = http://localhost:3000

### Create a workout
POST {{host}}/workout/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workoutType": "push",
  "workoutAlias": "Chest & Triceps",
  "notes": "Felt strong, bumped bench up 2.5kg",
  "startedAt": "2026-07-26T17:30:00.000Z",
  "finishedAt": "2026-07-26T18:45:00.000Z",
  "exercises": [
    {
      "exerciseKey": "barbell_bench_press",
      "exerciseName": "Barbell Bench Press",
      "orderIndex": 0,
      "sets": [
        { "setNumber": 1, "reps": 10, "weight": 60 },
        { "setNumber": 2, "reps": 8, "weight": 70 },
        { "setNumber": 3, "reps": 6, "weight": 80 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "exerciseKey": "incline_dumbbell_press",
      "exerciseName": "Incline Dumbbell Press",
      "orderIndex": 1,
      "sets": [
        { "setNumber": 1, "reps": 12, "weight": 22.5 },
        { "setNumber": 2, "reps": 10, "weight": 25 }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Minimal workout (only what the service actually reads)
POST {{host}}/workout/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workoutType": "legs",
  "workoutAlias": null,
  "notes": null,
  "startedAt": null,
  "finishedAt": null,
  "exercises": []
}

### List workouts (with exercises + sets)
GET {{host}}/workout/workouts
